    <string name="regles_du_jeu">Game Rules</string>
    <string name="regles">Drag your finger, aim straight and push the pufferfish onto the shoreline to win.\n\n Solo Mode: 1 vs 1 Team Mode: 2 vs 2\n\nEach player (or team) controls a bubble directly on the screen using their finger.\n\nUse your bubble to hit, block and propel the pufferfish (the puck).\n\nThe goal is to send the pufferfish into the opponent\'s camp, precisely behind the brown sand line (the goals).\n\nEach match is played with a maximum of 10 pufferfish.\n\nEach time a pufferfish crosses the opponent\'s brown sand line, you score 1 point.\n\nThe first player or team to reach 5 points wins the match.</string>
